{
 "slug": "events",
 "title": "Events",
 "excerpt": "Conferences, trainings, webinars and launches that matter to Bangladesh's development sector, with the latest coverage of each. Lead event · 9 to 20 November COP31 in Antalya: ministerial negotiations over adaptation finance.",
 "content": "\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.49), 19px);line-height:1.55\">Conferences, trainings, webinars and launches that matter to Bangladesh&#8217;s development sector, with the latest coverage of each.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\" style=\"margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:8px\"><img data-attachment-id=\"83\" data-permalink=\"/mangrove-river-maze-sundarbans/\" data-orig-file=\"/media/2026/10/devlens-sundarbans-aerial.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1280\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;default&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Mangrove River Maze, Sundarbans\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Photo: Amdadphoto / Wikimedia Commons, &lt;a href=&quot;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0&quot;&gt;CC BY-SA 4.0&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mangrove_River_Maze.jpg&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"/media/2026/10/devlens-sundarbans-aerial.jpg?w=1024\" src=\"/media/2026/10/devlens-sundarbans-aerial.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of rivers winding through the Sundarbans mangrove forest in Bangladesh\" class=\"wp-image-83\" style=\"border-radius:20px;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The Sundarbans, on the front line of climate change. Photo: Amdadphoto / <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mangrove_River_Maze.jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"border-radius:999px;color:#0e1116;background-color:#12b886;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:5px;padding-right:12px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;display:inline-block\">In progress · 9 to 20 November</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-1\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(23.043px, 1.44rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.466), 38px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">COP31 enters second week in Antalya: ministerial fight over adaptation finance</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\">The 31st UN Climate Change Conference (COP31) is underway in Antalya, TÃ¼rkiye, running from 9 to 20 November 2026. TÃ¼rkiye hosts the conference and works in partnership with Australia on the negotiations, as ministers arrive for the decisive high-level segment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\">For Bangladesh, negotiations are focused on ensuring adaptation finance is delivered strictly as grants rather than loans within the New Collective Quantified Goal (NCQG). Environment and planning delegations warned that vulnerable nations cannot take on debt burdens to protect coastal communities from sea-level rise and salinity intrusion. Earlier studies estimate Bangladesh requires upwards of US$8.5 billion annually for climate adaptation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\"><strong>What to watch:</strong> Ministerial drafts on a dedicated adaptation sub-target, the BelÃ©m-Antalya Action Mechanism for a just transition, and direct bilateral climate partnerships for Bangladesh.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-2\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(17.905px, 1.119rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.99), 28px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">Coming up</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>18 to 19 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-3\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">International Conference on Rural Development, Agriculture, and Sustainability (ICRDAS 2026)</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Brings together researchers, agriculture practitioners and NGO leads to discuss rural development strategies, climate-smart farming, food security and SDG alignment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>19 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Legal ruling Â· The Hague</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-4\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/11/15/icj-rohingya-genocide-judgment-november-19-gambia-myanmar/\">World court order on Rohingya genocide case (The Gambia v. Myanmar)</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The International Court of Justice delivers its judgment on preliminary objections under the 1948 Genocide Convention. Major implications for international accountability and the Rohingya refugee response in Bangladesh.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>25 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Consultation deadline</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-5\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/11/15/cyber-law-revised-draft-rumour-penalty-cut-five-years-comments-november-25/\">Public comments deadline: revised Cyber Security Act draft</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The revised Cyber Security (Amendment) Act draft halves rumour penalties to five years, but agencies retain content-blocking powers without prior court warrant. NGOs and civic rights groups can submit feedback until 25 November.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>30 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Award deadline</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-6\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://www.yves-rocher-fondation.org/en/how-to-apply-for-the-international-award/\">Terre de Femmes International Award 2027 closes</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The Yves Rocher Foundation&#8217;s EUR 10,000 prize for women-led environmental projects under the theme &#8220;Trees in the City&#8221;. Open to registered non-profits worldwide.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>10 to 11 Dec</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-7\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">Sustainable Technologies for Industry 5.0 (STI 2026)</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Exploring industrial decarbonization, green automation, circular economy practices and worker transitions across Bangladesh&#8217;s manufacturing and export sectors.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>11 to 12 Dec</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-8\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">11th International Public Health Conference 2026</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Organized by Public Health Foundation Bangladesh (PHFBD) at BIAM Foundation, bringing together public health practitioners, researchers and healthcare NGOs.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>28 to 29 Dec</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Summit Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-9\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">NRB World Summit 2026</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Biennial convention of Non-Resident Bangladeshi (NRB) investors, researchers and development professionals exploring cross-border partnerships, trade and community investments.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-10\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(17.905px, 1.119rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.99), 28px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">Recent events</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>16 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Workshop Â· Rajshahi</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-11\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">CLIK Hub Scoping Workshop at RUET</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Organized by RUET&#8217;s Department of Urban and Regional Planning and GIZ Bangladesh, scoping regional climate innovation and institutional research for northern Bangladesh.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>15 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Orientation Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-12\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">Parliament Secretariat orientation on SDGs and public resource oversight</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Two-day program supported by UNDP and Switzerland to strengthen lawmakers&#8217; oversight over public resource management and SDG tracking.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>14 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Summit Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-13\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"#\">5th Bangladesh Economic Summit 2026</a></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Organized by Bonik Barta at Pan Pacific Sonargaon, addressing macroeconomic stability, monetary policy reforms, energy diversification and LDC graduation strategies.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>9 to 10 Nov</strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference Â· Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-colo